import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.SingularCohomologyCup
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.PeriodTorusCohomologyCupSquare
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.PeriodTorusCohomologyCupPairs

/-!
# Native singular cup products and the distinguished period-torus square

This package constructs the Alexander--Whitney cup on actual integral
singular cohomology in all degrees, proves its naturality, identifies
the actual coordinate-pair classes and the distinguished period class
with their degree-one cup expressions, and computes the latter's square
on the genuine positive period-product generator.

The resulting coefficient is twelve in the stated real period order;
complex-orientation and geometric-intersection comparisons are separate.
-/
